WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The hardest part of a short quiet practice may be starting.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Twelve minutes can reveal which listening format you prefer.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Zen12 advertises twelve levels and four audio styles. Specifications are seller claims.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A 2023 review found mixed EEG evidence. It did not test Zen12.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Before buying, try silence, sound and guidance for free.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A clock measures time, not a seller's promised benefits.
